WEBVTT

00:07:58.432 --> 00:08:00.100
just six by 12 feet.

00:08:01.268 --> 00:08:03.938
Some of you may be thinking,

00:08:03.938 --> 00:08:05.856
"Well, building in space,

00:08:05.856 --> 00:08:10.903
this is a topic pretty far removed
from our day-to-day lives.

00:08:10.903 --> 00:08:14.323
How might it impact
what we do on Earth today?

00:08:15.324 --> 00:08:18.577
In my experience, designing
for an extreme environment

00:08:18.619 --> 00:08:25.501
that is the most restrictive
and that presents the most constraints,

00:08:25.543 --> 00:08:30.464
and which literally
no human has ever gone before,